menu "XiaoTai PCM audio part"

    config XIAOTAI_AUDIO_RETAIN_I2S_DMA
        bool "Keep I2S channels and DMA reserved after boot"
        default n
        help
            Reserve I2S DMA at boot. Idle closes the codecs and stops audio
            clocks without releasing DMA. The product selector enables this
            for boards without external RAM unless the product overrides it.

endmenu
